{
  "description": "Coordination hooks: KB-first reminder, live session_start_context.py register and inbox observer, an opt-in idle-wake waiter, a rotation-due watch hook, the memory-passthrough capture/session-context pair, and two spawn-injected worker hooks (a headless tool-allowlist gate on PreToolUse and a session-mapping capture on SessionStart) now also registered here directly (2026-08-24, seed feedback #40/S51.1) so a plugin-registered firing survives a managed policy's `strictPluginOnlyCustomization: [\"hooks\"]`, which strips the host adapters' own `--settings`-injected copy; both stay inert no-ops (exit 0, no side effect) on any session the adapters never marked as a fleet-managed spawn -- see each file's own module docstring for its exact env-var gate. Cadence ruling (2026-08-11): the KB-first and check-your-messages reminders fire on SessionStart (startup|resume|clear|compact), not UserPromptSubmit, so they stop repeating every prompt turn -- this changes CADENCE ONLY; the 2026-08-01 ruling that KB-first is unconditionally armed (no environment gate) still stands and is unchanged by this move. Session-cron sentinel (session_cron_sentinel.py) observes attempts with success unknown. Working-tree recovery saves (recovery_claude.py, added 0.10.0): five exec-form entries (PreToolUse Bash, PostToolUse file tools and Bash, Stop async, SessionEnd, SessionStart) that save uncommitted work before a shell command discards it and at the end of every turn; they print only systemMessage and additionalContext, exit 0 on every path and never block.",
  "hooks": {
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3",
            "args": [
              "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/optional_hook_runner.py",
              "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/session_context.py",
              "UserPromptSubmit"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "startup|resume|clear|compact",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3",
            "args": [
              "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/optional_hook_runner.py",
              "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/step_zero_reminder.py",
              "SessionStart"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3",
            "args": [
              "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/optional_hook_runner.py",
              "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/session_start_context.py",
              "SessionStart"
            ],
            "timeout": 30
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3",
            "args": [
              "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/optional_hook_runner.py",
              "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/session_context.py",
              "SessionStart"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
